 meet to  question Japan has also issued an arrest  warrant Ferguson's Lebanese wife for  giving false testimony but gone is a man  who has  in high places and believed to enjoy  political cover I am proud to be reppin  easy and Lebanon is the only country in  the world that stood by my side the  businessman turned fugitive doesn't hide  his confidence in his words he's ready  to stay a long time in Lebanon XANA  hodor al Jazeera Beirut
 

